# Captured between bacnet-probe and its simulated lift gateway (device 599)
# through a UDP relay, BVLC header removed: the requests the probe sends
# and the answers it parses, as the driver will in Phase 8.

# Who-Is to every network.
01 20 ff ff 00 ff 10 08 => to global, hops 255; unconfirmed-request service 8
# Who-Is for device 599 alone: a range of one.
01 20 ff ff 00 ff 10 08 0a 02 57 1a 02 57 => to global, hops 255; unconfirmed-request service 8 body 0a02571a0257
# I-Am: device 599, 1476 octets, no segmentation, vendor 999.
01 00 10 00 c4 02 00 02 57 22 05 c4 91 03 22 03 e7 => local; unconfirmed-request service 0 body c4020002572205c491032203e7
# ReadProperty of the device's object-name.
01 04 00 05 02 0c 0c 02 00 02 57 19 4d => expects-reply; confirmed-request invoke 2 service 12 max-apdu 1476 segments unspecified body 0c02000257194d
# Its Complex-ACK.
01 00 30 02 0c 0c 02 00 02 57 19 4d 3e 75 19 00 4c 69 66 74 20 67 61 74 65 77 61 79 20 28 73 69 6d 75 6c 61 74 65 64 29 3f => local; complex-ack invoke 2 service 12 body 0c02000257194d3e7519004c6966742067617465776179202873696d756c61746564293f
# A read of an object the device does not have: error class object (1),
# code unknown-object (31).
01 00 50 01 0c 91 01 91 1f => local; error invoke 1 service 12 body 9101911f
